  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Whispers around Subchain City speak of a duck once known as 'Riff,' a virtuoso musician who could coax liquid DRIP from even the most rusted pipes. When the DRIP dried up, Riff became a scavenger, haunting the Ashocks Shadow Lair, seeking lost chords and forgotten melodies amongst the wreckage.",
    "class": "Bard",
    "name": "Dust Riff",
    "personality": "Melancholic and resilient. Dust Riff is plagued by memories of a more vibrant past, expressing his grief through haunting tunes played on his skeletal frame. Underneath the hardened exterior, he still hopes to revive the lost rhythm of Subchain City, using his music to inspire hope.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Dust Riff plays a haunting melody on his own bones, creating a temporary sonic disruption that stuns nearby enemies. This allows allies to reposition or escape, or provides a brief window for a coordinated attack.",
